# Preset program templates (#81, M7.6).
#
# The MECHANISM ships; the TEMPLATES do not. Sets and reps are facts, but the
# selection, sequencing and progression of a published program are the author's
# expressive work, and committing one here would be redistribution.
#
# Templates you have lawful access to live in data/programs/ and stay local.
# Templates authored for this repo are named example-*.json and ARE tracked.
data/programs/*
!data/programs/README.md
!data/programs/example-*.json
